# updates screen-debian-off ------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Auto Updates. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. The$
# package installed with debconf's answer false: 20auto-$
# upgrades-disabled's two "0" lines. Enable writes hardn's file$
# alone.$
$
# Auto Updates #################################################$
$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured upgrades off$
$
# Update Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
   -  unattended-upgrades  Installed 2.12$
  [ ] Upgrades             Off by 20auto-upgrades$
  [ ] Package Lists        Off by 20auto-upgrades$
   -  Upgrade Timer        On apt-daily-upgrade.timer$
   -  Lists Timer          On apt-daily.timer$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable automatic updates$
      Daily, by unattended-upgrades$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

